(TCPC high-B C-quadrant sphere supplemental - T3 short probe.)
(Dedicated campaign 2026082401 mode 20; isolated from paired baseline data.)
(No WCS changes. No G43/G49 changes. TCPC must already be ON.)

(Operator setup:)
(1. Start at the Attempt 7 segment3 M2 B0/C0 return-top-clear point.)
(   Apply G43 H3 before G43.4; do not reseat T3 after the B0 anchor.)
(2. Keep hand on feed hold/stop for the full first run.)
(3. This exact file is frozen to mode 20, campaign 2026082401, T3 only.)
(4. It measures only C0/C90/C180/C270 at B45 and B90.)
(5. Sphere-to-post direction is X- Y+ Z-. B changes occur only at C0.)
(6. All sphere/post paths are verified; no pose-by-pose inspection holds.)
(7. This runner installs the frozen T3 #3032 value before probing.)
(8. Outside-G38 probe activity never pauses; each G38 requires clear inputs.)
(9. Every pose uses four contacts: W, safe -U toward +U, -V, and +V.)
(10. The underside +U start is never used; U center uses certified radius.)

(Sequence: B0/C0 open; B45 C0/C90/C180/C270/C0 closure;)
(B90 C0/C90/C180/C270/C0 closure; final B0/C0 outer closure.)
(C45/C135/C225/C315 are never commanded.)

(Accepted supplemental rows log only to:)
(/home/cnc5/linuxcnc-dev/configs/5th_axis_xyzbc_ssi_tcpc_probe_basic/tcpc-high-b-t3-supplemental-results.csv)
(Sequence-keyed machine state logs only to tcpc-high-b-t3-supplemental-state.csv.)
(Closure checks log only to tcpc-high-b-t3-supplemental-closures.csv.)

G21 G17 G40 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G94

o<preview_guard> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
  (DEBUG, TCPC_HIGH_B_T3_SUPPLEMENTAL preview only)
  M2
o<preview_guard> endif

(The TCPC HAL gates motion.probe-input only from real-time G38 motion type.)
(Clear legacy digital requests; this runner does not drive either physical gate.)
M65 P0
M65 P1

o<tcpc_enabled_required> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> LT 0.5]
